    {
      "name": "places/ChIJtefUZ_gDai4RVNiPQzcT87k/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OWmVsZGZkbXhMUkVGQk5qaGhWVFUyYkhCc1FsRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "I ordered Dalle iced tea, it had nata de coco and chia seeds. But unfortunately they didn't give me a big straw, they only gave me a small spoon. So it was a bit difficult. This Dalle iced tea has a slight pandan flavor. I want to try Dalle iced coffee next time.",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Td pesen dalle ice tea, ada nata de coco n chia seed.. tp sayang ga di ksh sedotan besar cuma di ksh sendok kecil. Jdnya aga sulit ya. Es teh dalle ini berasa pandan dikit. Next mw cb dalle ice coffee deh.",
        "languageCode": "id"
      },
      "authorAttribution": {
        "displayName": "dheybhie eats n travels book",
        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113421679918297880082/reviews",
        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoMApq2QpbYFAT7FGXKA6nl353RgqNSKKHpjMqT715Otg4MpE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
      },
      "publishTime": "2026-04-14T12:42:58.583540717Z",
      "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OWmVsZGZkbXhMUkVGQk5qaGhWVFUyYkhCc1FsRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OWmVsZGZkbXhMUkVGQk5qaGhWVFUyYkhCc1FsRRAB!2m1!1s0x2e6a03f867d4e7b5:0xb9f31337438fd854"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJtefUZ_gDai4RVNiPQzcT87k/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkalowNUtSVEZJZHkxRFpXZGliSFJNYjBwa00wRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "The coffee is delicious.\nThe pizza is okay.\nThe service is good.\nThe other menu items are interesting.\n\nThere's a private room for meetings.\n\nThe only shame is that there aren't any straws.\nCafes should still provide straws.\nStraws are cheap but crucial.\n\nIf you really want to go green, don't use plastic for your beverage packaging.\nThe important thing is that there are straws.\n\nThank you",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Kopi2an enak.\nPizza nya oke,\nService baik.\nMenu lain menarik2.\n\nAda private room bisa untuk meeting\n__\nCuma sayang nya 1 ga ada sedotan,\nHarusnya cafe tetap menyediakan sedotan.\nSedotan itu benda murah tp crusial.\n\nKalau emang mau go green kemasan minuman jgn plastik ganti beling,\nYg penting ada sedotan.\n\nTengkiu",
        "languageCode": "id"
      },
      "authorAttribution": {
        "displayName": "Budi P",
        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117123254812011662503/reviews",
        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVv-ofh_NqsJjEywX7fqpuAjKwDESBPOZ6HIwLQEN3_1ZAfNpM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
      },
      "publishTime": "2025-12-28T06:52:01.095772509Z",
      "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkalowNUtSVEZJZHkxRFpXZGliSFJNYjBwa00wRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkalowNUtSVEZJZHkxRFpXZGliSFJNYjBwa00wRRAB!2m1!1s0x2e6a03f867d4e7b5:0xb9f31337438fd854"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJtefUZ_gDai4RVNiPQzcT87k/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKNFNGY3RUelo2U1dOcWREbE5kakpXVkUxWE5uYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "The food is all delicious.\nService is a bit slow.\nBut it's worth it because the food is delicious.\n\nThe atmosphere is also calm, perfect for hanging out while working.",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Makanan enak semua.\nService agak lama.\nTapi terbayarkan karna rasanya enak.\n\nAtmosphere jg tenang, cocok untuk nongkrong di sini sambil kerja.",
        "languageCode": "id"
      },
